From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 23:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] snapdragon: copy the fallback DT to fdt_addr_r with overlays

With OF_LIBFDT_OVERLAY, the last allocation overwrites addr with
fdtoverlay_addr_r. Copy the control DT to the reserved fdt_addr_r instead,
so EFI/booti receive a valid fallback DT. Local fix for v2026.10-rc5;
Aurora enables overlays to retain labels required by the ABL hypervisor.
---
--- a/arch/arm/mach-snapdragon/board.c
+++ b/arch/arm/mach-snapdragon/board.c
@@ -568,7 +568,7 @@
 		log_warning("%s: Failed to reserve memory for copying FDT\n",
 			    __func__);
 	else
-		memcpy((void *)addr, (void *)gd->fdt_blob,
+		memcpy((void *)env_get_hex("fdt_addr_r", 0), (void *)gd->fdt_blob,
 		       fdt32_to_cpu(fdt_blob->totalsize));
 
 	configure_env();
